  "refinements": [
    "Sixteen selected producer families include an explicitly unclosed raw-client family; actual completion endpoints follow body/encoding/field/copy writes, not universal allocator-return or decref hooks",
    "Scheme/compiler supplies InitSpec semantics, roots, content/effect profiles and target check endpoints; native C or Zig realizes one service rather than duplicating late C-only semantic authority",
    "Safe vector completion differs from marker wrapper completion; actual source TODO for proc_or_false across allocation remains unresolved and is not a reproduced native failure",
    "Composite string-list intermediates retain roots through child pair construction; generic still-copy subtypes and pointer-free no-fill/native undefined refinement remain explicit admission gaps",
    "Next collection follows actual roots into both copied prefix and context suffix, then scans new destination work; old run membership does not create liveness or a generational policy",
    "One VM-authoritative layout/half epoch and actual source/destination borrower closure replace perprocessor-only orientation; forwarding address visibility does not prove copied body completion",
    "Tentative pre-GC hp capacity reservation, committed object extent, sparse padding and nominal overrun reserve differ; real completed objects using trigger reserve must enter frozen object layout and accounting",
    "AllocationCheckSpec requires actual target CFG/materialization/dynamic-constructor high-water bound B; compiler 4096, runtime F and ignored CHECK_HEAP m are distinct evidence, not universal reservation proof",
    "Native interval slow paths, root/continuation handler behavior, exact occupancy/public-counter deltas and ownership-aware shrink must replace whole-section assumptions together",
    "Actual physical section, allocated occupancy, live-after-GC words, factor-two policy, context allocation and still/native support are separate views; handoff creates no new Scheme object",
    "Eight handwritten conditional arguments and twenty-four logical counterexamples qualify no native profile; ten support rows, six maintenance events and five net conditions credit generated modern C and separate shared LLVM value from an unproved Zig increment"
  ],
